Raspberry Pi firmware, unmodified: https://github.com/raspberrypi/firmware
commit 0641c5bf (the one Circle uses): bootcode.bin, start.elf, start4.elf,
fixup.dat, fixup4.dat, bcm2711-rpi-4-b.dtb, bcm2711-rpi-400.dtb,
